      "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone!</p><p>I just got my copy of the Sentinels RPG Starter Kit and going to be GMing my first game in a week. However I was wondering if there was a New Character Creation Template? I didn't see one in the starter kit but I've heard many times that creating your own characters are possible so I figured there would be something floating around. Or as of this moment, do we have to just copy and paste the format or something?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p><p>Ventor</p>",
